\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0     You are the church's head, Lord Jesus,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj   We are your children, one and all;
\par   Great shepherd of the church we need  you,
\par   Be near your sheep in case we fall.
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6   Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj Our sins have made us all unworthy
\par    to claim in heav'n a resting-place;
\par   But you want all to reach repentance;
\par   Renew us by your saving grace.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   2.   We need your help, O loving   Father;
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj   Confirm and strengthen us today:
\par    And we will make a solemn promise
\par   to follow you along life's way.
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6     Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj So fill us with your love and wisdom;
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj Give us a faith sincere and true.
\par We'll serve you, Lord, with all our effort
\par And find our way to heav'n with you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.    May all who here have claimed your blessing
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Go on with you and do your will,
\par And what we here in church have promised
\par May we in daily life fulfill.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par You are the church's head, Lord Jesus,
\par We are your body, one and all;
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj Great Shepherd of the sheep, we need you,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Be near your sheep in case we fall.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

